STRANDED means the last atom to COMMIT this path has committed again SINCE
the file was last touched -- the lane moved on and the file did not. It does
NOT name the author of the edit: git cannot attribute an uncommitted edit at
all (H74), so this is evidence for an ask, never a verdict about a lane.
DO NOT COMMIT ANOTHER LANE'S FILE on the strength of it (MISSION_LOOP.md 13,
H19, H66). Post the list to livechat.log and let the owner answer.
